# The vendored bb-deployments compose stack (see .ci/buildbarn/bb-deployments)
# is not a Bazel package; ignore it so Bazel does not try to load it. The rest
# of .ci/buildbarn (project-config, smoke) stays loadable so the
# remote-execution harness targets can be built.
.ci/buildbarn/bb-deployments
